add('- Hard frozen K8 co-membership is less precise than the current continuous affinity at the same liver-pair recall in all three pools; it is not an upper bound. All variant comparisons and matched-recall envelopes use validation labels for diagnosis only. No model, shift or neighbour set was selected or changed.')
